  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "出演するはずだったタレントさんが、\r\n体調不良でキャンセルになったらしくてさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "代打になるんだけど……どうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やる！　やりたい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "受けることで休みがなくなっちゃうのは問題ないか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "久しぶりの完全なオフなのにさ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "全然！　お仕事もらえるの、すごく嬉しいよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "本当にお休みがほしい時は、ちゃんと言うから大丈夫！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だから、受けてもいいかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、それはこっちのセリフだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうな、めぐる\r\nOKの返事しておくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　ありがとー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010060"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0170",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それにしても……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近、特に頑張ってるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "イルミネとしての仕事もある中で──\r\nラジオに、バラエティ、他にも色々引き受けてくれて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへー！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だって、どんなお仕事もやってみたいんだもん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "できるなら、オファーをもらったお仕事は\r\n全部受けたいなーって！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、色々な経験を積むのはいいことだもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！\r\nまだまだ、やったことのないお仕事ってたくさんあるから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "機会をもらえるなら全部！　って思っちゃって……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だからね、わたしあれもすっごく楽しみなんだー！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……確かに\r\nめぐるの好きそうな感じだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でしょでしょ？\r\nライブ形式、すっごく盛り上がりそう！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それに、規模が大きいって聞いたから、\r\n色んな人に届けられるなって思って──",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そしたら、もうもう、ずっとわくわくしてるの……！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "きっとね、わたしのことを知らない人にも\r\nわたしのステージを届けられるでしょ！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それってすごいことだよね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\nかなり注目されるだろうし、視聴者の層も広いと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だよね……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──わたし、今、お仕事がすごく楽しいんだ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300301/1003003010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……めぐる？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003010230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ！　今までが楽しくなかったわけじゃないよ？！\r\n前よりもっとって意味で！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
